                        "entry_id": "7dd27a55-337e-388b-a43a-d4c113234412",
                        "glosses": [
                            "That serves as a warning to predators, as of toxicity, especially falsely."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "of a coloration or marking"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bd4dcdeb-ac26-476e-9309-d023ccf1e164",
                                "sense_id": "2463ad8c-8854-3100-b521-de005fca2a2c",
                                "text": "Episematic characters are far less common than aposematic, and these than cryptic; although, as regards the latter comparison, the opposite impression is generally produced from the fact that concealment is so successfully attained."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a5289cec-0cac-4945-9ce0-7567c3353835",
                                "sense_id": "2463ad8c-8854-3100-b521-de005fca2a2c",
                                "text": "Contrasting patterns of red and black are classic aposematic warnings that signal would-be predators to “back off, leave me alone … if you do not, you will regret the consequences.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
